The 100G receiver interface values come from the per-host
`spectral_line_100g_interfaces` inventory variable because interfaces bound to
VFIO are not reliably visible through the Linux network-interface APIs. The
SR-IOV sender address is queried live from the interface named by `Sender_Nic`.
